### Register Resistor Device in C++

Source: https://github.com/xyce/xyce/blob/master/src/DeviceModelPKG/index.dox

This C++ code demonstrates the registration of a 'Resistor' device within the Xyce simulator. The `registerDevice` function configures the device with instance and model types using the 'Traits' class.

```cpp
namespace Xyce {
namespace Device {
namespace Resistor {

void
registerDevice()
{
  Config<Traits>::addConfiguration()
    .registerDevice("r", 1)
    .registerModelType("r", 1);
}

} // namespace Resistor
} // namespace Device
} // namespace Xyce
```

