### Access Xyce Device Manager (C++)

Source: https://context7.com/xyce/xyce/llms.txt

Demonstrates how to obtain a reference to the Xyce Device Manager in C++ to query and manage circuit devices. This requires including the necessary headers and initializing the Xyce simulator object.

```cpp
// Access device manager for device interrogation
#include <N_CIR_Xyce.h>
#include <N_DEV_DeviceMgr.h>

Xyce::Circuit::Simulator xyce;
xyce.initialize(argc, argv);

// Get device manager reference
Xyce::Device::DeviceMgr& deviceMgr = xyce.getDeviceManager();

// Query device parameters (implementation-specific)
// Device manager handles all device instantiation and parameter management
```
